<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 111 0 R
/E (The most important conclusion is that metadata must become a first-class deliverable. Without metadata, the shapefiles are technically usable but difficult to audit, reproduce, update or compare. A strong metadata framework should describe each dataset, each variable, each geographic reference, every transformation rule, and the quality status of the output.)
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
